{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d33f9af2bfec1f7b0a06b267c4893b13d0ee9f9a38c88c00fb89aad91b48a683",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545b4975ef370b9b01f1beae8adcd5a2945bde9c6b354d6d10d9b9fa50b31412",
      "text": "距离生日还有一周……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3488d509183d25eda58c67c88d58e0a94d400982a7b2f6960426212b5860b593",
      "text": "那么，今天的练习就到这里！\n另外，我们有件事要通知春名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ef680185cc0995615d111bf5fc1270c3a44d684530d7c397d5fd795d84700c6",
      "text": "春名亲的生日，我们居然\n要邀请你参加派对哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e4a700e306d6c3bd683ed33a8730d5fc9a8fe000099335fdb3bbb8e8887a6fa",
      "text": "虽然说是邀请，但其实是在事务所办啦。\n春名，你会来吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:441d677a2f7549c77a130b9b0429ca2c2c989fed2593f563bc28e7726199d081",
      "text": "真的吗！？我绝对去！\n谢啦，大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:427e15c8441874effb85b892a3048a1359a108614af199223b6cf4175d9053f4",
      "text": "绝妙的礼物……\n大家也在准备中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc7de04610c0dafe31180e2b62d66c0b5d09be33233ff5df223a7ae158f8951",
      "text": "是大家分工合作准备的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c33c3bf97db80e76d5a8e670e166441c69f87004a5f7f0bb3a218752902170b9",
      "text": "嘿，旬都这么说了，到底会是什么呢。\n超级期待啊，下周快点来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3e24c706b5b66eafc6ca784953cd5469743c652b4dcf5b6cedaf676d4fd6de",
      "text": "啊，当天因为要准备，所以我们会先去。\n春名你之后再慢悠悠地来事务所吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ded4128be357498d2eca766384e19ec8a857183d5611786faf8956afff768ed",
      "text": "哦，收到。\n主角只要压轴登场就行了对吧，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
